<title>UK: Jan Brent programme 44 cargoes, 1.51 mln bls topup.</title>
<headline>Jan Brent programme 44 cargoes, 1.51 mln bls topup.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The January North Sea Brent Blend crude oil loading programme has been set at the equivalent of 44 500,000-barrel standard cargoes and 1.509 million barrels in smaller top-up cargoes, traders said.</p>
</text>
